    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Hashalaq Kalashtar</h2>\n<p>The hashalaq quori is a force that feeds on doubt and desire. You can choose one of the following paths.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Hashalaq Insightful</h3>\n<p>You become trained in Deception (or another skill if you were already trained in Deception). You gain the @Compendium[pf2e.feats-srd.Dvz54d6aPhjsmUux]{Lie To Me} skill feat. In addition, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus against any attempt to lie to you.</p>\n<p> </p>"
